# The Gobbiebag Part I (jeuno 27): the template's Mog Satchel arm (the same code for every part: GobbiebagQuest's 73
# finish). A Mog Satchel of 30 (storage satchel; a fresh char has none, and only charCreate with
# START_INVENTORY over 30 or the !setbag GM command give one). Accepted by a GM: the four items: 73 (36), finished:
# completed, the inventory 35 and the satchel 35, INVENTORY_INCREASED.
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
storage satchel 30                      # a Mog Satchel (char_storage.satchel), the arm getContainerSize(MOGSATCHEL) > 0
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI accepted
item SquareOfDhalmelLeather
item SteelIngot
item SquareOfLinenCloth
item Peridot
login
trade Bluffnix SquareOfDhalmelLeather x1 SteelIngot x1 SquareOfLinenCloth x1 Peridot x1 # the four items: 73 (36)
finish                                  # completed; inventory 35; the satchel 30 -> 35; INVENTORY_INCREASED
